            "text": "theorem phase_dV (ε p pz x0 : ℝ) (F G : Slow → ℝ) (q : Slot)\n    (hF : DifferentiableAt ℝ F q.1) (hG : DifferentiableAt ℝ G q.1) :\n    fderiv ℝ (phase ε p pz x0 F G) q eV = -(p * F q.1 + pz * G q.1)"
